What is printed by this class with overloaded constructors distinguishing parameter order?

```java
class MessageToken {
    String summary;
    MessageToken(int code, String tag) {
        this.summary = "INT:" + code + "-" + tag;
    }
    MessageToken(String tag, int code) {
        this.summary = "STR:" + tag + "-" + code;
    }
}
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        MessageToken m1 = new MessageToken(10, "Alert");
        MessageToken m2 = new MessageToken("Alert", 10);
        System.out.println(m1.summary + " | " + m2.summary);
    }
}
```

Trace constructor delegation across the following overloaded constructors. What is output?

