Trace execution of this subclass delegating to overloaded superclass constructors. What is output?

```java
class BaseAccount {
    String plan;
    BaseAccount() {
        this("Free");
    }
    BaseAccount(String p) {
        this.plan = p;
    }
}
class PremiumAccount extends BaseAccount {
    int discount;
    PremiumAccount(int d) {
        this.discount = d;
    }
    PremiumAccount(String p, int d) {
        super(p);
        this.discount = d;
    }
}
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        PremiumAccount a1 = new PremiumAccount(15);
        PremiumAccount a2 = new PremiumAccount("Corporate", 30);
        System.out.println(a1.plan + "-" + a1.discount + " " + a2.plan + "-" + a2.discount);
    }
}
```
